{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:af:schema:findings-sarif:1",
  "title": "af/findings-sarif@1 SARIF 2.1.0 findings log",
  "$comment": "What `af task findings ID --format sarif` and `af review report --format sarif` print (ADR-0248): one SARIF 2.1.0 log with one run. This schema states the SARIF 2.1.0 required structure af writes — `version`, `$schema`, `runs[].tool.driver`, each result's `ruleId`, `message`, `locations` and `level`, each invocation's `executionSuccessful` — and af's profile in the run's `properties`, whose `schema` is af/findings-sarif@1. It is not the official OASIS schema, which a later change vendors.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "$schema",
    "version",
    "runs"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "$schema": {
      "const": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json"
    },
    "version": {
      "const": "2.1.0"
    },
    "runs": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/run"
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "digest": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "run": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "tool",
        "invocations",
        "results",
        "properties"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "tool": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "driver"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "driver": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "version",
                "rules"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "const": "af"
                },
                "version": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "informationUri": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "rules": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "id",
                      "name",
                      "shortDescription"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^af-review/"
                      },
                      "name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1
                      },
                      "shortDescription": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "required": [
                          "text"
                        ],
                        "properties": {
                          "text": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "invocations": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "executionSuccessful",
              "toolExecutionNotifications"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "executionSuccessful": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "toolExecutionNotifications": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "level",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "level": {
                      "enum": [
                        "none",
                        "note",
                        "warning",
                        "error"
                      ]
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/message"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "results": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/result"
          }
        },
        "properties": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "schema",
            "round",
            "snapshot_id",
            "coverage",
            "verified_fixed"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "schema": {
              "const": "af/findings-sarif@1"
            },
            "task_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "campaign": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "round": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "snapshot_id": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/digest"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "coverage": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/coverage"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "verified_fixed": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/verified_fix"
              }
            }
          },
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "task_id"
              ]
            },
            {
              "required": [
                "campaign"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "$comment": "The af profile: the Task or the Campaign, the round and Snapshot reported, what it covered (null when nothing was reviewed), and the findings a verification record proved fixed."
        }
      }
    },
    "message": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "text"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "text": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        }
      }
    },
    "result": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "ruleId",
        "ruleIndex",
        "level",
        "message",
        "locations",
        "properties"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "ruleId": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^af-review/"
        },
        "ruleIndex": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "level": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "note",
            "warning",
            "error"
          ]
        },
        "message": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/message"
        },
        "locations": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/location"
          }
        },
        "partialFingerprints": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "suppressions": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "kind",
              "status"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "kind": {
                "const": "external"
              },
              "status": {
                "const": "accepted"
              },
              "justification": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "properties": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "title",
            "severity",
            "reviewer",
            "status",
            "agent_prompt"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "title": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "severity": {
              "enum": [
                "minor",
                "major",
                "blocker"
              ]
            },
            "reviewer": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "status": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
              ]
            },
            "agent_prompt": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/agent_prompt"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "object",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "required": [
            "physicalLocation"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "physicalLocation": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "artifactLocation"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "uri"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "uri": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    }
                  }
                },
                "region": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "startLine"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "startLine": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "minimum": 1
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "required": [
            "logicalLocations"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "logicalLocations": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "name"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "kind": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "agent_prompt": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "location",
        "evidence",
        "requested_change",
        "verification",
        "text"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "location": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "file",
            "line",
            "snapshot_id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "file": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 65536,
                  "pattern": "\\S"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "line": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "snapshot_id": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/digest"
            }
          }
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "requested_change": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "verification": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "The finding handed to the agent that will fix it (ADR-0248): its location on the Snapshot the round reviewed (`file` and `line` null for a change-wide finding), the quoted evidence, the requested change (the reviewer's fix, or what is asked when it proposed none), how verification will judge a fix, and all of it as one prompt `text`."
    },
    "coverage": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "subject",
        "reviewers",
        "paths"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "subject": {
          "enum": [
            "diff",
            "whole_tree"
          ]
        },
        "reviewers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "reviewer",
              "state",
              "reason"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "reviewer": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 4096,
                "pattern": "\\S"
              },
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "reviewed",
                  "not_run"
                ]
              },
              "reason": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 65536,
                    "pattern": "\\S"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "state": {
                  "const": "not_run"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "reason": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 65536,
                  "pattern": "\\S"
                }
              }
            },
            "else": {
              "properties": {
                "reason": {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "paths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "path",
              "state"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 4096,
                "pattern": "\\S"
              },
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "reviewed",
                  "partially_reviewed",
                  "not_reviewed",
                  "outside_round"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "$comment": "What the round covered (ADR-0248). Each reviewer is `reviewed` (no findings from it means none found) or `not_run` with why (no findings from it means nothing). Each path of a diff round's Subject, then each path a finding names outside it (`outside_round`); a whole-tree round lists the paths its findings name. A path inside the round is `reviewed` when every reviewer ran, `partially_reviewed` when some did, `not_reviewed` when none did."
    },
    "verified_fix": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "finding_id",
        "record_id",
        "snapshot_id"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "finding_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4096,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "record_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/digest"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/digest"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "A finding verified fixed: the positive verification record that says so (an `af/TaskFixReceipt@1` on the Task path, a `FixVerification@1` on the Campaign path) and the Snapshot it was verified on. Nothing else is reported as verified fixed."
    }
  }
}
